--- !u!114 &1539270142
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1539270140}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 28610d01f37f1ae4d9d5878365afa88e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  endingTiers:
  - {fileID: 1616717282}
  - {fileID: 1359880492}
  - {fileID: 447231066}
  - {fileID: 359060216}
  - {fileID: 46560387}
  finalTextLines:
  - I won. But at what cost? My ambition pushed me forward, but it blinded me. I
    failed to connect with the public, missed opportunities to forge alliances, and
    found myself alone. I may have the brilliance of a star, but it will fade tomorrow
    morning. The world will not only forget me, but also what my fight stood for.
    I should have tried harder.
  - "Alright. It wasn\u2019t that bad. I sang, fought, and kept my head high. At
    least I caught people\u2019s attention, so my name might last a little longer
    on their lips. But it\u2019s not enough. Not for me. I should have pushed harder,
    reached worldwide fame, and carried my message to a wider audience."
  - "Oh wow. I can\u2019t believe all my efforts paid off! It was tough, I won\u2019t
    lie. I know that if I\u2019d moved differently or attacked another way, I could
    have shone like never before. Still, my songs will reach far beyond this audience.
    At the very least, my ideals will spread in rumors. Let the Music Revolution
    begin!"
  - Shout my name, for the star has arrived! Well, not quite. But I deserve a little
    love after all. I left it all here, in this competition. Which means so much
    more than it seems. A battleground, a place to test the true value of human-made
    art. This is my letter to you. I wish I could have inspired the entire country
    to rise up if only I had, perhaps, dodged more attacks or been faster.
  - This is how it's done! To all those who didn't believe in me, who looked down
    on me, who said I was wasting my time making music- in your faces! This is a
    revelation, a revolution. I won't let anyone hold us back anymore. We must be
    free from what others have to say. And to all those who have lost the spark of
    creativity and passion, I will be their reminder. I will be the light that guides
    them to a much more colorful reality. Shine bright and be a Neon Super Star like
    me!
  finalText: {fileID: 1212833619}
